Subject: [PATCH] Decode FIX candidates into ordered annotated fields

---
 src/decode.js       |  22 ++++++++++
 test/decode.test.js | 101 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 123 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 src/decode.js
